# Normalise line endings in the repository.
#
# Shell scripts and container entrypoints must keep LF endings: they are executed
# inside an Alpine Linux image, where a CRLF shebang fails with
# "not found" for an interpreter that plainly exists.

* text=auto eol=lf

*.sh text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.tar binary
